# Environment — Money Autopilot / Hermes

Copy to `.env` in project root (or set in Hostinger / n8n).

```bash
# Public URLs
APP_BASE_URL=https://autopilot.moneymagnettools.com
TOOLS_BASE_URL=https://tools.moneymagnettools.com

# Stripe — shared webhook secret for all revenue lanes
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_...
STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_...
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...

# Outreach lane — Money Autopilot Engine ($197)
# STRIPE_PRICE_ID_ENGINE=price_...
OUTREACH_WEBHOOK_URL=https://your-n8n.app/webhook/outreach-events
OUTREACH_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your-long-random-secret

# Sovereign lane — Solar B2B ($15K entry / $25K enterprise)
STRIPE_SOLAR_ENTRY_CHECKOUT_URL=https://checkout.stripe.com/...
STRIPE_SOLAR_ENTERPRISE_CHECKOUT_URL=https://checkout.stripe.com/...
SOVEREIGN_APPLY_URL=https://yourdomain.com/apply

# 33333 lane — Stripe Payment Links (15 products, see docs/33333/)
# STRIPE_LINK_VV_BEAT_PACK=https://buy.stripe.com/...
# CONVERTKIT_API_KEY=...
# CONVERTKIT_FORM_VAULTVERSE=...
# CONVERTKIT_TAG_ABANDONED_CART=...

# Webhook auth secrets
HERMES_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your-long-random-secret
N33333_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your-long-random-secret

# 33333 optional
# GEMINI_API_KEY=...
# GOOGLE_SHEET_ID=...
# GOOGLE_DRIVE_VAULT_FOLDER=...
# LEAD_MAGNET_BASE_URL=...
# FOUNDER_EMAIL=founder@example.com

# Calendar + Notion (SGOS/Hermes)
APPROVAL_REMINDER_TZ=America/New_York
NOTION_APPROVAL_QUEUE_URL=https://notion.so/...
NOTION_MASTER_MAP_URL=https://notion.so/...
NOTION_HERMES_STATUS_URL=https://notion.so/...
```

## Revenue lanes (three parallel funnels)

| Lane | Price | Stripe integration | API prefix |
|------|-------|-------------------|------------|
| **Outreach** | $197 Engine | Checkout Session API | `/api/checkout/*`, `/api/outreach/*` |
| **33333** | $9–$497 consumer | Payment Links | `/api/33333/*` |
| **Sovereign** | $15K Solar B2B | Payment Links (static URLs) | `/api/sovereign/*` |

Shared webhook: **`POST /api/webhooks/stripe`** — routes by session metadata (`productId` or `brand`).

## n8n environment

| Variable | Value |
|----------|--------|
| `APP_BASE_URL` | Money Autopilot server URL |
| `TOOLS_BASE_URL` | Tools hub URL |
| `HERMES_WEBHOOK_SECRET` | Hermes calendar trigger auth |
| `N33333_WEBHOOK_SECRET` | 33333 n8n route auth |
| `FOUNDER_EMAIL` | Sale notification inbox |

