- **`docs/n8n/outreach-welcome-sale.workflow.json`** — $197 Engine welcome + sale emails
- **`docs/n8n/33333-autopilot-revenue-engine.workflow.json`** — 33333 consumer lane
- **`docs/n8n/sovereign-loop.workflow.json`** — SG3 → Hermes → Ling → K3 (Solar B2B)

